        <div class="index__card">
          <h3 class="index__card-title">OEM Clothing Manufacturing</h3>
          <p class="index__card-text">Your design brief arrives, our production team takes it from tech pack to finished garment — pattern grading, fabric sourcing, cutting, sewing, and finishing all handled in-house under your brand label. No middlemen, no outsourced processes, no compromises on quality control.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="index__card">
          <h3 class="index__card-title">ODM — We Design, You Brand</h3>
          <p class="index__card-text">No tech pack? No problem. Choose from our existing base designs, then customise the fabric, colour, print, and trims to match your brand. You get a unique product with your own label sewn in — without the cost of a full design team. ODM is popular with buyers who need speed to market. Minimum 300 pieces per style applies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="index__card">
