      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1px;">
        <div class="index__card" style="flex: 1;">
          <h3 class="index__card-title">Sustainable Clothing Manufacturer — GOTS Certified & Ethical Production</h3>
          <p class="index__card-text">As a certified sustainable clothing manufacturer, our GOTS certification covers the entire production chain — from raw cotton sourcing through spinning, dyeing, and final garment production. We are an ethical clothing manufacturer with BSCI, SEDEX, SA8000, and WRAP social compliance covering fair wages, safe conditions, and no forced or child labour. GRS certified recycled polyester and OEKO-TEX 100 tested materials are available across all product categories. Full chain-of-custody documentation provided with every order. See our <a href="/sustainability" class="index__link" title="Sustainable clothing manufacturing practices">sustainability practices</a> and <a href="/gots-certified-clothing-manufacturer" class="index__link" title="GOTS certified clothing manufacturer Bangladesh">GOTS certification details</a>.</p>
